      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这位曾指导过众多名赛马娘的训练员，\n他的新学生……\n会编织出怎样的花束呢，真是非常期待啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a21dbf63486931988e0bdf3875ef34ecc9b34d3f19be7f66090983aef1166ffa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
