      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她本应能以她自己的方式奔跑，\n不仅如此，\n她本可以绽放出更加耀眼的光芒的，不是吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "553172d06711a2f57bda545aec098698f3e5279030b626ec40f109eef52d8032",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
