    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b78077c8ae1a0a7f516689",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是在知晓了她的梦想之后，\n才和她签下担当契约的。\n既然如此，我便有责任去一心一意实现它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa0dfb13f2896bc0a473edefbb67bd346e301893d9ee54d7b20cd2c233d7bc7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
