      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，『日经赏』伴随着希望落下了帷幕——\n通往『天皇赏（春）』的\n训练日程，终于正式拉开了序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abab1189a23addf3925f2b6c1efdc5b2c96f87c9de290da5e9d57620e2e75d74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
