    {
      "uid": "zhcn:169df96fe3fbbc2a800599c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她以远超以往的强大，\n实现了长足的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88324da66c804160a9382b9c45be062c4841203bdacc3920bd433b202961aa78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
