    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:473d3eb12791f521c0af3d26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拿下『天皇赏（春）』的冠军。\n原本仿佛是遥不可及的目标，\n而今天的结果，却让它一下子拉近到了现实之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6d070907397052ef81b449afdf8af7c4c5260a686af19e5a1cf949fcca9add",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134313.json",
      "json_path": [
