        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9051a481b3fb6ab2ca1820",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——作为一名后冠路线的赛马娘，\n能在『天皇赏（春）』中取得成果，\n一定会为她带来瞩目的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04ef006fbe37e50341f8b137e278a149c35f031a6aa8b3747a624b66ffe51654",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a12f2a0de638598eda9ac1a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是为了实现她的梦想，\n还是为了让她能够绽放光芒——",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e3dc53e922e32a54c743e7680d367301610ea0c4da7b38af693f67ece01a9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134313.json",
      "json_path": [
